<p class="sounds-lead">A sound plays from a button the tag writes, from an element of the page a
selector finds, from any element that names it, from a toast as it shows - and goes out as a WAV
file. Each example below is its template and what it does: click the buttons.</p>

{ways}
<section class="sounds-way">
  <h2>{$wayTitle}</h2>
  <p>{$wayText}</p>
  {example $page/}
</section>
{/ways}
